{
  "description": "A dev project with a FOV inventory of fovmanager (exportProject's FovInventory=): the sessions' FOV positions and sizes (swapped for an FOV turned a quarter), the subjects' first windows (dev's clockwise theta as a counterclockwise rotation; a subject the sessions name gets a row), outlines other than the shape's own (an ellipse of a round window, a polygon of a custom trapezoid), the images as BMP files and photos, injections (a depth that is not a number said with what was injected), annotations as notes and the headbar labels, in the ophys module's FOV map data. Mice and sessions that are not here, extra windows and FOVs with no session are named in the warnings.",
